# Every Python dependency of the repo's code, for all of it at once: resolved
# with requirements-test.in into requirements_lock.txt, served as the one @pip
# hub. Each Bazel target still gets only the packages its own deps name, so
# nothing here reaches an image that doesn't use it.
aioboto3  # facade
boto3  # orchestration, scripts/send_pdf.py
fastapi  # facade
httpx  # facade, orchestration, scripts/send_pdf.py
pydantic-settings  # facade, orchestration
python-multipart  # facade
redis  # facade
temporalio  # orchestration
tenacity  # scripts/send_pdf.py
uvicorn[standard]  # facade
